Garden East, Karachi.', 'Institute of Business Administration', 'Mr. Muhammad Wali Saleem', 'Officer-Coordination', 8, 9, 9, 10, 9, 10, 9, 9, 9, 9, 'He visited OPD, Dialysis centre & Physiotherapy unit to interview patients. He was responsible for the Facebook group which ensured quick and effective communication with interns possible for us. He was also assigned to make contact with potential sponsors and drafted customized letters for the Internship concluding ceremony. He also visited Ahram house, Collection Points, Hospitals on panel, Slaughter house and kitchen department.', 'Hammad is a hard-working person who performed all tasks assigned to him in a dedicated and sincere fashion. He has a great sense of maturity and wisdom in his words and suggestions. He was one of those few interns who came to AWT for his moral character building. He has very good personnel skills and can easily bond and effectively communicate with almost everyone.', 'Nisar Ahmed', 'Coordinator', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'hammad.riaz@live.com', 'BBA', NULL, '2017', '2017-05-30 00:00:00', '03132738413', NULL, 0, 'completed', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 'Muhammad Riaz', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL);
